---
// Why Travel With Shree Chowdeshwari Tours & Travels (Modern Clean Theme)
---

<section id="why-us" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14 space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-blue-700">
        ✦ The Shree Chowdeshwari Advantage
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
        Why Choose Our Tours &amp; Cabs?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        We own 100% of our fleet and employ full-time verified drivers so you never have to worry about aggregators or last-minute cancellations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Value Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all space-y-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
          🚗
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">
          100% Verified Own Fleet
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Company-owned Innova Crystas, Fortuners, Urbanias &amp; Tempo Travellers sanitized before every dispatch. Zero third-party brokers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all space-y-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
          👔
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">
          Verified Master Chauffeurs
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Police background-checked drivers with 10+ years of highway experience, fluent in Kannada, English &amp; Hindi.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all space-y-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
          💳
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">
          Transparent All-Inclusive Billing
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          All toll fees, interstate permits, driver bata, and fuel charges are 100% covered. Pay only 25% token to confirm.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-lg transition-all space-y-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
          📡
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">
          24/7 Live Operations Desk
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Live GPS tracking, flight arrival monitoring, and dedicated trip coordinator support for peace of mind.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
